      "content": "It's understandable that therapy feels inadequate when the damage seems so vast, but the point is to help you manage the unbearable weight of that guilt. While it won't erase what happened, it can offer tools to navigate the self-loathing that is consuming you right now. You are not defined solely by your worst moment, and seeking help is an act of surviving, not of excusing. Please consider reaching out to a crisis line if these feelings become too overwhelming.",
